{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图文对齐与生成式 VLM：开放语义不等于视觉事实</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Vision-Language Models</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_100_llava_med-title\">LLaVA-Med</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">其贡献主要是将 LLaVA 两阶段训练移到生物医学域：PMC 图注概念对齐后再做合成医学指令微调。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Adapts the LLaVA visual-instruction-tuning paradigm to biomedicine via two-stage training: PMC figure–caption alignment followed by GPT-4-synthesized biomedical instruction tuning.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">生物医学图像、图注或用户指令/问题</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Biomedical image + user clinical question or conversational instruction</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">面向图像的自回归回答、描述与解释文本</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Open-ended autoregressive biomedical explanation, visual QA response, or figure analysis</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 3 · PDF p.5</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/2023/hash/5abcdf8ecdcacba028c6662789194572-Abstract-Datasets_and_Benchmarks.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_100_llava_med')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_100_llava_med')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"LLaVA-Med original paper architecture figure, Figure 3\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/b4b0768232ea1ee84270.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 3 · PDF p.5</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_100_llava_med', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_100_llava_med\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_100_llava_med')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_100_llava_med', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_100_llava_med\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生物医学图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">来自 PMC 图文对及下游医学问答数据</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests biomedical image + user clinical question or conversational instruction and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"来自 PMC 图文对及下游医学问答数据\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests biomedical image + user clinical question or conversational instruction and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"生物医学图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_100_llava_med', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">生物医学图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">来自 PMC 图文对及下游医学问答数据</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests biomedical image + user clinical question or conversational instruction and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"由论文图注和 GPT-4 辅助构造的对话式任务\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"文本指令\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 02\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_100_llava_med', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">文本指令</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 02</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">由论文图注和 GPT-4 辅助构造的对话式任务</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"提取 patch-level 视觉 token\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs CLIP ViT vision encoder within the core biomedical visual instruction tuned mllm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"CLIP ViT vision encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"CLIP ViT vision encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_100_llava_med', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>CLIP ViT vision encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">提取 patch-level 视觉 token</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs CLIP ViT vision encoder within the core biomedical visual instruction tuned mllm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把视觉特征映射到 LLM token embedding 维度\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs multimodal projector within the core biomedical visual instruction tuned mllm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"线性 multimodal projector\" data-node-name-en=\"multimodal projector\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_100_llava_med', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">线性 multimodal projector</span><span class=\"lang-en\">multimodal projector</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把视觉特征映射到 LLM token embedding 维度</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs multimodal projector within the core biomedical visual instruction tuned mllm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"用过滤后的 PMC 图像—图注数据先训练视觉语言连接\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 05 within the core biomedical visual instruction tuned mllm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"生物医学概念对齐阶段\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 05\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_100_llava_med', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">生物医学概念对齐阶段</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 05</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">用过滤后的 PMC 图像—图注数据先训练视觉语言连接</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 05 within the core biomedical visual instruction tuned mllm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"接收视觉 token 与指令 token 并自回归解码\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs LLaVA/Vicuna language model within the core biomedical visual instruction tuned mllm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"LLaVA/Vicuna language model\" data-node-name-en=\"LLaVA/Vicuna language model\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_100_llava_med', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>LLaVA/Vicuna language model</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">接收视觉 token 与指令 token 并自回归解码</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs LLaVA/Vicuna language model within the core biomedical visual instruction tuned mllm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"对生成的多模态问答/对话数据继续优化\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies fine-tuning to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"医学指令微调\" data-node-name-en=\"fine-tuning\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_100_llava_med', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">医学指令微调</span><span class=\"lang-en\">fine-tuning</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">对生成的多模态问答/对话数据继续优化</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies fine-tuning to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"图像问答、描述或研究辅助文本\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces open-ended autoregressive biomedical explanation, visual qa response, or figure analysis via multimodal.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"医学多模态回答\" data-node-name-en=\"multimodal\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_100_llava_med', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">医学多模态回答</span><span class=\"lang-en\">multimodal</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">图像问答、描述或研究辅助文本</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces open-ended autoregressive biomedical explanation, visual qa response, or figure analysis via multimodal.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"LLaVA-Med Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 视觉投影对齐后的医学指令生成</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Linear/MLP Visual Projection + Two-Stage Biomedical Autoregressive Instruction Tuning</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"LLaVA-Med：核心公式 · 视觉投影对齐后的医学指令生成\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"100\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"21.339504pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.723074 -69.011212 252.008017 21.339504\" width=\"252.008017pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M5.637638-1.607918L5.478832-1.687321C5.012337-1.042169 4.754276-.794034 4.327483-.595525C3.960242-.426793 3.285314-.327539 2.530982-.327539C1.975