 xlink:href=\"#m100_g13-72\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"107.160805\" xlink:href=\"#m100_g10-67\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"113.77021\" xlink:href=\"#m100_g7-106\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"119.327079\" xlink:href=\"#m100_g13-72\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"124.301725\" xlink:href=\"#m100_g10-159\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"129.443544\" xlink:href=\"#m100_g10-67\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"132.887105\" xlink:href=\"#m100_g13-150\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"137.745501\" xlink:href=\"#m100_g7-187\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"141.441625\" xlink:href=\"#m100_g13-69\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"146.313349\" xlink:href=\"#m100_g20-59\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"151.022314\" xlink:href=\"#m100_g13-26\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"157.38545\" xlink:href=\"#m100_g10-41\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"163.47988\" xlink:href=\"#m100_g7-185\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"167.345384\" xlink:href=\"#m100_g13-64\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"172.725209\" xlink:href=\"#m100_g7-186\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"176.540885\" xlink:href=\"#m100_g7-188\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"180.456199\" xlink:href=\"#m100_g7-186\" y=\"-58.831901\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">通用 LLaVA 缺医学术语和科研图像知识，人工指令数据昂贵</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">General LLaVA lacked biomedical terminology and figure interpretation skills, while manual clinician instruction datasets were unavailable.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">将生物医学视觉编码器通过投影连接到 LLM，并用合成指令数据微调</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Project BiomedCLIP/ViT visual tokens into an LLM and fine-tune on multi-turn biomedical instructions synthesized from PubMed captions.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">利用 PubMed 图注生成大规模医学多模态指令并高效训练</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Fast 15-hour two-stage curriculum: Stage 1 linear projection concept alignment on PMC-15M + Stage 2 end-to-end synthetic instruction tuning.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用于生物医学图像问答、解释与研究辅助</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Widely adopted open-source baseline for biomedical VQA, conversational research assistance, and MLLM benchmarking.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">重要开放基线；合成指令偏差和临床真实性限制直接部署</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Foundational open medical MLLM; synthetic caption-derived instructions cannot substitute for verified clinical DICOM ground truth.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">先把预训练视觉特征映射进语言模型 embedding 空间。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">先做图像—图注概念对齐，再用医学指令数据训练对话遵循。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">保持 LLaVA 的简单线性连接结构，以数据构造而非复杂 fusion 获得领域能力。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Project BiomedCLIP/ViT visual tokens into an LLM and fine-tune on multi-turn biomedical instructions synthesized from PubMed captions.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Fast 15-hour two-stage curriculum: Stage 1 linear projection concept alignment on PMC-15M + Stage 2 end-to-end synthetic instruction tuning.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Linear/MLP Visual Projection + Two-Stage Biomedical Autoregressive Instruction Tuning.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">适合生物医学图像问答、论文图像解释与医学教学研究。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">PMC 图注偏研究图表而非临床全流程，回答可靠性和患者级安全性必须单独验证。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Widely adopted open-source baseline for biomedical VQA, conversational research assistance, and MLLM benchmarking.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Foundational open medical MLLM; synthetic caption-derived instructions cannot substitute for verified clinical DICOM ground truth.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/2023/hash/5abcdf8ecdcacba028c6662789194572-Abstract-Datasets_and_Benchmarks.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>LLaVA-Med: Training a Large Language-and-Vision Assistant for Biomedicine in One Day</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/microsoft/LLaVA-Med\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
